{/*
  The warm/cold door availability matrix. It follows the repo-owned diagram contract in
  docs/design/docs-site-visual-blueprint.md §5: static, prop-free, theme-aware inline SVG;
  token-only colors; operational labels at 16px or larger; and equivalent wide/narrow reading
  orders. The ordinary-stage ○ glyph is used for every row, including the visibly dev-only audit
  stage. This is an availability matrix, so it deliberately has no arrows or connectors.

  Every row carries data attributes for the registry facts. Post-build checks compare the two
  variants with shared/registry.yaml and verify that each visible yes/— value agrees with those
  attributes. The media query removes one complete variant from rendering and the accessibility
  tree at every width. Each SVG owns its title and description ids.
*/}

